.TH CHARBUF_GETC 3
.SH NAME
charbuf_getc \- read and consume the next character into a pointer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <charbuf.h>
.P
.BI "ssize_t charbuf_getc(charbuf* " b ", unsigned char* " ch ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR charbuf_getc ()
reads the next character from
.I b
into
.I ch
and advances the read pointer.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of bytes read (1) on success, or non-positive on EOF or error.